{"id":"ea25e09b331cbbdb","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-structure.md","title":"First-order structure (legacy)","display":"df-structure — First-order structure (legacy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-structure","aliases":["27-df-structure"],"display":"df-structure — First-order structure (legacy)","depends_on":["[[27-df-atomic-formula]]"],"local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-structure — First-order structure (legacy)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"23484c14c788f5da\" href=\"?note=23484c14c788f5da\" title=\"27-df-atomic-formula\">27-df-atomic-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}(S),\\mathrm{Func}_m(S),\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}(S),\\mathrm{Func}_m(S),\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"23484c14c788f5da\" href=\"?note=23484c14c788f5da\" title=\"27-df-atomic-formula\">27-df-atomic-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 是候选集合对象。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1,\\pi_2\">\\(\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\)</span> 为有序对投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I:\\mathcal L_S\\to W\">\\(I:\\mathcal L_S\\to W\\)</span> 使用集合函数的通常含义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 是一个集合。引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_S\">\\(\\mathcal L_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>。载体记号定义在全部合法结构上；符号解释另外要求局部参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathcal L_S\">\\(s\\in\\mathcal L_S\\)</span>，不要求签名含有符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\cup\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N^+}\\mathrm{Func}_m(S)\\cup\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N^+}\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\cup\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N^+}\\mathrm{Func}_m(S)\\cup\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N^+}\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists A,W\\;\\exists I\\in W^{\\mathcal L_S}\\;\\left[\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\;(I(c)\\in A)\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_m(S)\\;(I(f):A^m\\to A)\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S)\\;(I(R)\\subseteq A^m)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists A,W\\;\\exists I\\in W^{\\mathcal L_S}\\;\\left[\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\;(I(c)\\in A)\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_m(S)\\;(I(f):A^m\\to A)\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S)\\;(I(R)\\subseteq A^m)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\langle A,I\\rangle|\\coloneqq A\\quad(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\langle A,I\\rangle,S)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\langle A,I\\rangle|\\coloneqq A\\quad(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\langle A,I\\rangle,S)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s^{\\langle A,I\\rangle}\\coloneqq I(s)\\quad(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\langle A,I\\rangle,S),\\ s\\in\\mathcal L_S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s^{\\langle A,I\\rangle}\\coloneqq I(s)\\quad(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\langle A,I\\rangle,S),\\ s\\in\\mathcal L_S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>旧稿将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> 独占于 Remark，且未把结构对象与解释数据绑定；现在两者由有序对明确连接。候选错误形状时结构谓词为假，不从一个自由的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 推断结构真值。</li>\n<li>载体按原稿保持非空。这里没有把全部结构组成一个集合；后续量词对集合编码的结构使用此谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"23484c14c788f5da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"23484c14c788f5da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"签名 $S$、$\\mathrm{Const}(S),\\mathrm{Func}_m(S),\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S)$ 见 [[27-df-atomic-formula]]；$\\mathfrak A$ 是候选集合对象。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}(S),\\mathrm{Func}_m(S),\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1,\\pi_2","display":false},{"tex":"I:\\mathcal L_S\\to W","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathcal L_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\cup\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N^+}\\mathrm{Func}_m(S)\\cup\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N^+}\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists A,W\\;\\exists I\\in W^{\\mathcal L_S}\\;\\left[\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\;(I(c)\\in A)\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_m(S)\\;(I(f):A^m\\to A)\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S)\\;(I(R)\\subseteq A^m)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"|\\langle A,I\\rangle|\\coloneqq A\\quad(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\langle A,I\\rangle,S)).","display":true},{"tex":"s^{\\langle A,I\\rangle}\\coloneqq I(s)\\quad(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\langle A,I\\rangle,S),\\ s\\in\\mathcal L_S).","display":true},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":2276,"backlinks":[{"id":"9ab26a4ec0de4af8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$\\mathrm{Var}$ 见 [[27-df-structure]] 及其内建签名上游。"},{"id":"b8e62c8bd1e70617","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 固定；$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 是候选结构编码，$\\mathrm{Struct}$ 见 [[27-df-structure]]。"},{"id":"81e99b41571ec995","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元